WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Linda Park: CAPA-118 on the label print smearing is still open, what's blocking closure?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Carlos Ibarra: We're waiting on the printhead vendor to confirm the replacement part ships this week.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Linda Park: Let's set a hard follow-up date and escalate if it slips again.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Grace Liu: I can confirm the part tracking number and update the log today.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Linda Park: Good, and CAPA-114 on the seal leak is ready to move to verification.
